{"chapters":[{"title":"Plain recursion","code":"def rob(nums):\n    def line(lo, i):           # most money from houses lo..i\n        if i < lo:\n            return 0\n        return max(line(lo, i - 1), nums[i] + line(lo, i - 2))\n\n    n = len(nums)\n    if n == 1:\n        return nums[0]\n    return max(line(1, n - 1), line(0, n - 2))","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Plain recursion</strong> &mdash; O(&phi;<sup>n</sup>) time, O(n) extra space. Input: <code>rob(nums=[2, 3, 2])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","2"],"cls":["","",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>def line(lo, i):</code> <em>(most money from houses lo..i)</em>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","2"],"cls":["","",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>n = len(nums)</code> &mdash; <code>n = 3</code>","line":7,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","2"],"cls":["","",""]}],"vars":[["n","3",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>if n == 1:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (n = 3)","line":8,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","2"],"cls":["","",""]}],"vars":[["n","3",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return max(line(1, n - 1), line(0, n - 2))</code> &mdash; calls <code>line(lo=1, i=2)</code>","line":10,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","2"],"cls":["","src","src"],"ptr":{"2":["i"],"1":["lo"]}}],"vars":[["n","3",0],["lo","1",1],["i","2",1]],"stack":["rob(nums)","line(lo=1, i=2)"]},{"caption":"<code>if i &lt; lo:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (i = 2, lo = 1)","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","2"],"cls":["","src","src"],"ptr":{"2":["i"],"1":["lo"]}}],"vars":[["n","3",0],["lo","1",0],["i","2",0]],"stack":["rob(nums)","line(lo=1, i=2)"]},{"caption":"<code>return max(line(lo, i - 1), nums[i] + line(lo, i - 2))</code> &mdash; calls <code>line(lo=1, i=1)